\item[\ \ translation aspects:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate} 
\item within this language:\\

\item in other languages:\\

\end{enumerate}
\item[* relevant literature/documents:]
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\
Note that the ordering 
of conjsents may be relevant for pronominal reference; therefore, the strategy 
is to preserve the ordering of (conj)sents as much as possible.
\item modifications:\\

\end{enumerate}
\end{description}

